{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"d98cff90428e8ca2","name":"card_unit_5th_regiment","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Japan/CovertOp/units/card_unit_5th_regiment","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"5th REGIMENT","text":"When you lose a kredit slot, this unit gets +2+1 if on the battlefield or -2 cost if in hand.","flavorText":"The 5th Infantry Regiment was a unit of the 8th Division of the Imperial Japanese Army. The division was formed in 1898 and participated in the Russo-Japanese War, the Japanese invasion of Manchuria and finally the Pacific War. On September 19th, 1941, the 8th Division was assigned to the 20th Army to defend the Soviet Union border alongside the 25th Division. It remained stationed in Manchukuo during the initial phases of the Pacific War. In July 1944 the 8th Division was moved to the Philippines and after its arrival the 5th Regiment was transferred to Leyte where it was destroyed during the Battle of Leyte against the US forces. The remainder of the division participated in the Battle of Manilla in January 1945, where it suffered heavy losses. The survivors stopped fighting on September 2nd, 1945 after the surrender of Japan.","faction":"Japan","type":"infantry","rarity":"Common","cost":4,"operationCost":0,"attack":4,"defense":4},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_5th_regiment","title":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_5th_regiment_title","SourceString":"5th REGIMENT","LocalizedString":"5th REGIMENT"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":4,"defense":4,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Japan","kredits":4,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_5th_regiment_text","SourceString":"When you lose a kredit slot, this unit gets +2+1 if on the battlefield or -2 cost if in hand.","LocalizedString":"When you lose a kredit slot, this unit gets +2+1 if on the battlefield or -2 cost if in hand."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_5th_regiment_history","SourceString":"The 5th Infantry Regiment was a unit of the 8th Division of the Imperial Japanese Army. The division was formed in 1898 and participated in the Russo-Japanese War, the Japanese invasion of Manchuria and finally the Pacific War. On September 19th, 1941, the 8th Division was assigned to the 20th Army to defend the Soviet Union border alongside the 25th Division. It remained stationed in Manchukuo during the initial phases of the Pacific War. In July 1944 the 8th Division was moved to the Philippines and after its arrival the 5th Regiment was transferred to Leyte where it was destroyed during the Battle of Leyte against the US forces. The remainder of the division participated in the Battle of Manilla in January 1945, where it suffered heavy losses. The survivors stopped fighting on September 2nd, 1945 after the surrender of Japan.","LocalizedString":"The 5th Infantry Regiment was a unit of the 8th Division of the Imperial Japanese Army. The division was formed in 1898 and participated in the Russo-Japanese War, the Japanese invasion of Manchuria and finally the Pacific War. On September 19th, 1941, the 8th Division was assigned to the 20th Army to defend the Soviet Union border alongside the 25th Division. It remained stationed in Manchukuo during the initial phases of the Pacific War. In July 1944 the 8th Division was moved to the Philippines and after its arrival the 5th Regiment was transferred to Leyte where it was destroyed during the Battle of Leyte against the US forces. The remainder of the division participated in the Battle of Manilla in January 1945, where it suffered heavy losses. The survivors stopped fighting on September 2nd, 1945 after the surrender of Japan."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::CurrentExpansion","EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger"],"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Japan/07_Covert_Operations/5th_regiment.5th_regiment","SubPathString"